":true,"resource":{"url":null,"sourceId":"L067","requestedPath":"increments/u05-u08-l041-l068-v1/evidence/L067/page-3.png","kind":"missing_source_page","sha256":null,"bytes":null},"originalUrl":"source-original/L067.docx","sourceTitle":"12.1 随机现象与样本空间（1）-教学设计","sourceStatus":"partially_reviewed"},{"id":"ev:book3:L067:para25:four-phenomena-classification:5","sourceId":"L067","sourceSha256":"72b7f9756efb6ea007ba77376bec5d15b5e0bec575fade6d8d278ec4b5ae9013","locator":{"headingPath":["硬币落地朝向与存款股票收益的四现象辨析"],"part":"word/document.xml","paragraphIndex":25,"tableIndex":null,"rowIndex":null,"cellIndex":null,"renderedPage":3,"printedPage":null,"pdfPage":3,"equationObjectId":null},"quote":"[问题1]如果将上述现象进行分类，你会如何分？依据是什么？","quoteRepresentation":"native_xml_text_verbatim","quoteCompleteness":"原XML文字层逐字拼接。","wordingChecked":true,"mathChecked":true,"mathSourceAsset":null,"rawMetadataRetainedInOriginalJson":true,"resource":{"url":null,"sourceId":"L067","requestedPath":"increments/u05-u08-l041-l068-v1/evidence/L067/page-3.png","kind":"missing_source_page","sha256":null,"bytes":null},"originalUrl":"source-original/L067.docx","sourceTitle":"12.1 随机现象与样本空间（1）-教学设计","sourceStatus":"partially_reviewed"},{"id":"ev:book3:L067:para26:four-phenomena-classification:6","sourceId":"L067","sourceSha256":"72b7f9756efb6ea007ba77376bec5d15b5e0bec575fade6d8d278ec4b5ae9013","locator":{"headingPath":["硬币落地朝向与存款股票收益的四现象辨析"],"part":"word/document.xml","paragraphIndex":26,"tableIndex":null,"rowIndex":null,"cellIndex":null,"renderedPage":3,"printedPage":null,"pdfPage":3,"equationObjectId":null},"quote":"现象1，向上抛掷硬币，硬币因为重力的作用必然落在地面上，结果具有确定性；现象2，向上抛掷十枚硬币，可以发现硬币落地后有些是正面朝上，有些是反面朝上，所以向上抛掷一枚硬币，在硬币落地前，我们无法预知究竟哪一面朝上，或者说结果具有不确定性；现象3，由于本金和利率都是确定的，所以一年后每份存款的利息收入必然是元，结果具有确定性；现象4，十种股票一年的收益有多有少．事实上，同一种股票这一年的收益与前一年的收益也会有所不同．影响股票涨跌的因素有很多，购买一种股票，一年后的收益在购买时是无法精确预计的，或者说结果具有不确定性．","quoteRepresentation":"native_xml_text_verbatim","quoteCompleteness":"原XML文字层逐字拼接；嵌入公式不在文字层中，完整式子见mathTranscription、sourceSupportedTranscription及原页图。